      "summary": "A Pennsylvania legislator shared a directory of state grant and loan programs available to constituents, municipalities, nonprofits, and other organizations. The release points residents to an existing Pennsylvania Grant Directory and a Commonwealth online search tool to find financial assistance programs across various state agencies. No new legislation or funding was created; the legislator is redistributing existing informational resources.",
